2.4 Named Personas (SREpresentation)
2.5Target Audience
1. Students: exercise for health and aesthetics; highly budget restricted.
2. Young working people: maximize sessions around routines; receptive to digital tools.
3. Middle aged working people: job and family first; exercise for longevity.
4. Stay at home parents: errands and housework first; highly fragmented time.
2.6 Competitor Analysis
Hevy: experienced lifters, manual input, serious design, social motivation.
Fitbod: beginners, instant generation, expensive subscription, gamification.
