Wireframe coverage note: the sketches cover account creation, home, profile, settings,
the diagnostic quiz and adjusted program, program management, exercise exploration,
active workout logging, rest timer, completion summary, and history. They do not yet show
Voice Quick Log, Lock Screen Quick Add, automatic rep counting, Save Point Resume
Card, Micro-Session classification, Weekly Rep Bucket, or Set Stitching, which appear in
the MVP stories.
10.Items to ReconcileBeforeWriting the SRS
1. Quiz trigger: the Core Features, Flow, and Value Proposition material says 14 or more
days of inactivity; the MVP breakdown (Story 4) says 7 day inactivity. Pick one value or
make it configurable.
